---
title: OCR — extract text from scanned PDFs
description: Run OCR in your browser to make scanned PDFs searchable or export text.
relatedTool: ocr-pdf
---

Turn image-based PDF pages into **searchable text** or export plain text / tables.

## Steps

1. Open **OCR PDF**.
2. Upload a scanned or image-based PDF.
3. Select OCR languages (English, Slovak, Czech, German, Polish, …).
4. Optionally limit the page range.
5. Run OCR and download:
   - Searchable PDF, or
   - Plain text / Excel (when available)

## Tips

> **Tip:** Higher-resolution scans produce better OCR accuracy. Re-scan at 300 DPI if results are poor.

- OCR runs locally — large documents may take time on slower devices.
- For mixed documents, process only the scanned page ranges.

